  "arrangerNotes": "Gospel song, verse 1 and chorus, verified against the Wikisource LilyPond transcription of Grand Army War Songs (1886): the vocal line of the verse (pp. 92-93) and the soprano of the chorus (p. 93). The score's rests are kept. No simplification needed. D drum: as written (range 2 to high 2), D minLayout 13. C drum: the C drum has no high 2, so 'see the signal' and 'now appearing' (last four notes of the first and third lines) and the whole line 'Wave the answer back to heaven' are played one octave lower; C minLayout 11. C and D arrangements differ where noted above (each fits its own drum).",
  "verified": true
